{"id":"43fcc2f44ce938e0","group":"68","path":"68/68-df-turing-degree.md","title":"Turing Degree","display":"df-turing-degree — Turing Degree","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Recursion Theory (Shoenfield)","book_abbrev":"68","label":"68-df-turing-degree","aliases":["68-df-turing-degree"],"display":"df-turing-degree — Turing Degree","depends_on":["[[68-df-turing-equivalence]]","[[68-df-turing-jump]]"],"source_edition":"1993 original; 2016 Cambridge reissue, supplied PDF","source_location":"§15 pp.53-55 / PDF 62-64; jump p.59 / PDF 68","verification_status":"source-adapted-definition","source_proof_status":"not-checked"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Recursion Theory (Shoenfield)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"68"},{"key":"label","html":"68-df-turing-degree"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>68-df-turing-degree</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-turing-degree — Turing Degree"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"b2e9363a9f103e32\" href=\"?note=b2e9363a9f103e32\" title=\"68-df-turing-equivalence\">68-df-turing-equivalence</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"36459bc8c6a3f6a6\" href=\"?note=36459bc8c6a3f6a6\" title=\"68-df-turing-jump\">68-df-turing-jump</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"1993 original; 2016 Cambridge reissue, supplied PDF"},{"key":"source_location","html":"§15 pp.53-55 / PDF 62-64; jump p.59 / PDF 68"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-adapted-definition"},{"key":"source_proof_status","html":"not-checked"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\subseteq\\mathbb N\">\\(A\\subseteq\\mathbb N\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\equiv_T\">\\(\\equiv_T\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"b2e9363a9f103e32\" href=\"?note=b2e9363a9f103e32\" title=\"68-df-turing-equivalence\">68-df-turing-equivalence</a>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varnothing&#39;\">\\(\\varnothing&#39;\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"36459bc8c6a3f6a6\" href=\"?note=36459bc8c6a3f6a6\" title=\"68-df-turing-jump\">68-df-turing-jump</a>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\deg,\\mathcal D,\\mathbf0,\\mathbf0&#39;\">\\(\\deg,\\mathcal D,\\mathbf0,\\mathbf0&#39;\\)</span> 均由下式构造。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\deg(A):=\\{B\\subseteq\\mathbb N:B\\equiv_T A\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\deg(A):=\\{B\\subseteq\\mathbb N:B\\equiv_T A\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal D:=\\{\\deg(A):A\\subseteq\\mathbb N\\},\\qquad\\mathbf0:=\\deg(\\varnothing),\\qquad\\mathbf0&#39;:=\\deg(\\varnothing&#39;).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathcal D:=\\{\\deg(A):A\\subseteq\\mathbb N\\},\\qquad\\mathbf0:=\\deg(\\varnothing),\\qquad\\mathbf0&#39;:=\\deg(\\varnothing&#39;).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>把原先只在 Remark 给出的度集合和零度常元移入 Assertion。原书将全函数的等价类称为度，并在 p.54 说明每个度都有集合代表，所以此集合表示与原书度结构相应。零跳与 K 的度相同，见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"87e145f3544aae62\" href=\"?note=87e145f3544aae62\" title=\"68-thm-jump-theorem\">68-thm-jump-theorem</a>；不要求 ∅′=K。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"68-df-turing-equivalence","status":"resolved","id":"b2e9363a9f103e32","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[68-df-turing-equivalence]]","embed":false},{"target":"68-df-turing-jump","status":"resolved","id":"36459bc8c6a3f6a6","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[68-df-turing-jump]]","embed":false},{"target":"68-df-turing-equivalence","status":"resolved","id":"b2e9363a9f103e32","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$A\\subseteq\\mathbb N$，$\\equiv_T$ 见 [[68-df-turing-equivalence]]，$\\varnothing'$ 见 [[68-df-turing-jump]]。$\\deg,\\mathcal D,\\mathbf0,\\mathbf0'$ 均由下式构造。","embed":false},{"target":"68-df-turing-jump","status":"resolved","id":"36459bc8c6a3f6a6","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$A\\subseteq\\mathbb N$，$\\equiv_T$ 见 [[68-df-turing-equivalence]]，$\\varnothing'$ 见 [[68-df-turing-jump]]。$\\deg,\\mathcal D,\\mathbf0,\\mathbf0'$ 均由下式构造。","embed":false},{"target":"68-thm-jump-theorem","status":"resolved","id":"87e145f3544aae62","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Remark]","excerpt":"把原先只在 Remark 给出的度集合和零度常元移入 Assertion。原书将全函数的等价类称为度，并在 p.54 说明每个度都有集合代表，所以此集合表示与原书度结构相应。零跳与 K 的度相同，见 [[68-thm-jump-theorem]]；不要求 ∅′=K。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"A\\subseteq\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"\\equiv_T","display":false},{"tex":"\\varnothing'","display":false},{"tex":"\\deg,\\mathcal D,\\mathbf0,\\mathbf0'","display":false},{"tex":"\\deg(A):=\\{B\\subseteq\\mathbb N:B\\equiv_T A\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathcal D:=\\{\\deg(A):A\\subseteq\\mathbb N\\},\\qquad\\mathbf0:=\\deg(\\varnothing),\\qquad\\mathbf0':=\\deg(\\varnothing').","display":true}],"bytes":1200,"backlinks":[{"id":"4ed6f28789f0aa57","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathbf a,\\mathbf b\\in\\mathcal D$，$\\deg$ 见 [[68-df-turing-degree]]，集合 $\\oplus$ 见 [[68-df-effective-join]]。以下重载 $\\oplus$ 的参数均为度。"},{"id":"4ad7581c464c34d3","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathbf a\\in\\mathcal D$，$n\\in\\mathbb N$；$\\mathcal D,\\deg,\\mathbf0$ 见 [[68-df-turing-degree]]，集合跳跃见 [[68-df-turing-jump]]。[[68-lem-jump-representative-invariance]] 给出同度代表的跳跃仍同度。"},{"id":"93be4ecb17896d81","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"1a0c04c58a0ab7cb","anchor":"ref-7","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Bin}_{68}$，$\\mathrm{RecTree}$ 与以自然数集合表示的路径集 $[T]$ 见 [[68-df-recursive-tree]]。$\\mathrm{Recursive}$、$\\deg$、$\\mathrm{Minimal}$ 分别见 [[68-df-recursive-set]]、[[68-df-turing-degree]]、[[68-df-minimal-degree]]。$\\mathrm{MinDegTree}$ 是以下验收谓词。"},{"id":"c98683963f144de2","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathbf a\\in\\mathcal D$，$\\mathbf0$ 见 [[68-df-turing-degree]]，度序见 [[68-df-partial-order-on-degrees]]。"},{"id":"52c2209f400df1a9","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathbf a,\\mathbf b\\in\\mathcal D$，度及其集合代表见 [[68-df-turing-degree]]，集合归约见 [[68-df-turing-reducibility]]。以下 $\\le$ 仅指度序，$<$ 为其严格部分；$\\preceq$ 是该关系的集合图。"},{"id":"4516136f3cd44eb2","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{RE},W_e$ 见 [[68-df-recursively-enumerable-set]]，$\\deg,\\mathcal D$ 见 [[68-df-turing-degree]]。$\\mathrm{REDeg}$ 是以下定义的集合。"},{"id":"5d155589c3b42c38","anchor":"ref-8","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Bin}_{68}$；有限二进制串、$\\mathrm{RecTree}$ 及由自然数集合表示的路径集 $[T]$ 见 [[68-df-recursive-tree]]。$\\mathrm{Recursive}$、$\\deg$、$\\mathrm{Minimal}$ 分别见 [[68-df-recursive-set]]、[[68-df-turing-degree]]、[[68-df-minimal-degree]]。$\\mathrm{MinDegTree}$ 只取 [[68-df-minimal-degree-tree]] 中已定义的谓词，本条不重新定义它，也不假设存在通过验收的树。"},{"id":"879b42e91247e55b","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"1391f74d0e8dd998","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathcal D,\\mathbf0$ 见 [[68-df-turing-degree]]，度序见 [[68-df-partial-order-on-degrees]]，度 join 见 [[68-df-degree-join]]，度跳跃见 [[68-df-degree-jump]]。跳跃性质见 [[68-thm-jump-theorem]]。"},{"id":"7eb62978269b937a","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathcal D$ 见 [[68-df-turing-degree]]，$\\mid$ 见 [[68-df-incomparable-degrees]]。"},{"id":"58958dc4062fef0f","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathcal D,\\deg,\\mathbf0$ 见 [[68-df-turing-degree]]，度序见 [[68-df-partial-order-on-degrees]]，$\\mathrm{Minimal}$ 见 [[68-df-minimal-degree]]。"},{"id":"f850298d5e806601","anchor":"ref-27","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[68-df-turing-degree]]"},{"id":"be41c4d7dd143cb1","anchor":"ref-92","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[68-df-turing-degree]] — definition"},{"id":"3cb8c24064050ea6","anchor":"ref-29","locations":["正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"相对计算与度：[[68-df-oracle-computation]] → [[68-df-turing-reducibility]] → [[68-df-turing-degree]]；[[68-df-turing-jump]]、[[68-thm-posts-theorem]]、[[68-thm-friedberg-muchnik-theorem]]。"}],"outgoing":["b2e9363a9f103e32","36459bc8c6a3f6a6","87e145f3544aae62"]}